    title: "PROJECT-WIDE: 5 catalogues ship third-party rows (elixir 155, haskell 68, swift 38, go 33, python 4 ungoverned) while ~15 user-facing strings assert stdlib-only; scope gates exist for 6 of 14 languages"  # 097c
